  "description": "Keep your 2025-2026 RAM 1500 Quad Cab interior protected with OEDRO custom floor liners. Built using 3D laser scanning technology, these TPE all-weather mats provide a precise fit without interfering with pedals. Raised edges and deep channels help contain dirt, water, snow, and spills, while the odorless recyclable material delivers durable, pet-friendly protection.\nFeatures\nPrecision Custom Fit for RAM 1500 Quad Cab: Designed with advanced 3D laser scanning technology, these floor mats are precisely molded for 2025-2026 RAM 1500 Quad Cab models with front bench seat and without rear under-seat storage, providing a tailored fit while maintaining proper pedal clearance for safe and comfortable driving.\nPremium GRS Certified TPE Material: Crafted from upgraded GRS certified recyclable TPE material, these RAM 1500 floor liners are odorless, non-toxic, flexible, and durable. The high-quality material provides reliable protection against daily wear while supporting a cleaner and more comfortable driving environment.\nAll-Weather Protection for Every Journey: Built with raised edges and deep channels to help contain mud, snow, water, sand, and spills. These waterproof floor liners protect your truck’s original carpet from harsh weather, outdoor adventures, and everyday messes.\nStylish Design Inspired by RAM Interior: Featuring a unique pattern inspired by the original RAM 1500 interior, these custom floor mats combine practical protection with a factory-style appearance, helping enhance your truck cabin while keeping it clean and organized.\nEasy Cleaning & Long-Lasting Protection: Designed for convenience, these heavy-duty floor liners can be easily removed, shaken off, or rinsed with water. Perfect for commuting, hauling, road trips, camping, and off-road adventures, they provide dependable interior protection all year round.\n2-years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2025-2026 RAM 1500 Quad Cab models\nWith front bench seat type\nWithout rear under-seat storage",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
